{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main1500_rival_01",
      "hash": "557f619c8abb9067",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「唉～！\\n屬於我的時代竟然如此短暫！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main1500_rival_04",
      "hash": "557f5c9c8abb87e8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "從現在開始，[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n就是真正的冠軍了！\\c\\n而我也有新的目標要挑戰了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_01",
      "hash": "b00cec58886a7564",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_02",
      "hash": "b00cef58886a7a7d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳終於做到了！\\n我由衷地恭喜[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\r\\n稱霸了寶可夢聯盟！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_08",
      "hash": "b00ce558886a697f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "比起那個剛剛捉到[VAR POKNAME(0002)]、\\n啟程去收集寶可夢圖鑑時的[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\r\\n現在的[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳真的成長了很多！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_09",
      "hash": "b00ce458886a67cc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀哎呀！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]真的長大了呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_03",
      "hash": "b00cee58886a78ca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！\\n你直到最後一刻都沒有放棄，\\r\\n真是太棒了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_10",
      "hash": "b009e7588868370e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你的戰鬥方式……\\n還有你對寶可夢和[VAR TRNAME(0000)]\\r\\n投入了太多的關愛。\\c\\n也許就只是這些許的破綻，\\n才使得你沒能贏得勝利吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_04",
      "hash": "b00ce958886a704b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "總之，你們兩個的對戰\\n實在是太精彩了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main1500_rival_02",
      "hash": "557f629c8abb921a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「……謝謝博士！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_05",
      "hash": "b00ce858886a6e98",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\c\\n我想[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳應該明白……\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳能夠成功稱霸寶可夢聯盟，\\r\\n靠的不只是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一個人的力量！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳和寶可夢之間絕妙的搭配，\\n實在令人不得不佩服啊！\\c\\n那麼……[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳跟我來吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main1500_rival_03",
      "hash": "557f639c8abb93cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「唉～！\\n果然還是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳厲害啊！\\c\\n不過我可不會放棄！\\n我會一次一次不斷挑戰冠軍的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_06",
      "hash": "b00ceb58886a73b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main1500_doctor_07",
      "hash": "b00cea58886a71fe",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "恭喜[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳稱霸寶可夢聯盟！\\c\\n為了保住這冠軍的寶座，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳必定付出了\\r\\n遠比常人更多的努力！\\c\\n為了表揚[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的奮鬥，\\n請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳跟我來吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p02_cave_d1405",
      "hash": "564e959046db4e49",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 14]"
